---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Resume" description="Beto Moreno — Staff Product Manager, global product leader with 12+ years in B2B SaaS and marketplace platforms.">
  <article class="container page" data-pagefind-body>

    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Beto Moreno</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Staff Product Manager · Cardedeu, Barcelona · <a href="mailto:betomorenob@gmail.com">betomorenob@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p class="summary">
        Global product leader with 12+ years in B2B SaaS and marketplace platforms. Experienced in building software for professionals to manage workflows, operations, and monetization. Proven ability to lead global product strategy, drive cross-platform integrations, enable cross-sell, and deliver scalable products across geographies.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="resume-section">
      <h2>Experience</h2>

      <div class="role">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Staff Product Manager</h3>
            <span class="company"><a href="https://www.deel.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Deel</a> · Remote</span>
          </div>
          <span class="period">Aug 2024 — Present</span>
        </div>
        <p class="role-summary">Lead 3 teams to build real-time payroll integrations across global markets, aligning platform and compliance needs.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Launched 0→1 real-time payroll automation integration, reducing processing time from 36 minutes to real-time.</li>
          <li>Drove cross-country integration roadmap aligned with platform expansion and ARPU growth.</li>
          <li>Delivered global integrations across HRIS systems enabling ecosystem scale and cross-sell.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="role">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Product Director</h3>
            <span class="company"><a href="https://factorialhr.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Factorial</a> · Hybrid, Barcelona</span>
          </div>
          <span class="period">Jan 2023 — Aug 2024</span>
        </div>
        <p class="role-summary">Led global product teams to scale platform capabilities and drive cross-sell.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Directed strategy across 8 teams, aligning platform modules and local market needs.</li>
          <li>Achieved 1.7x YoY ARR growth by consolidating platform and enabling ecosystem adoption.</li>
          <li>Led the first Factorial AI team to design and deploy core GenAI infrastructure, enabling integration across multiple product teams.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="role">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Senior Product Manager</h3>
            <span class="company"><a href="https://www.adevinta.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Adevinta</a> · Hybrid, Barcelona</span>
          </div>
          <span class="period">Mar 2022 — Jan 2023</span>
        </div>
        <p class="role-summary">Delivered monetization tools for professionals using marketplace publishing software.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Launched new monetization product generating €500k CARR in month one.</li>
          <li>Built business management workflows for professional publishers.</li>
          <li>Led collaboration across sales and product to expand professional tool adoption.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="role">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Senior Product Manager</h3>
            <span class="company">Taiger · Remote</span>
          </div>
          <span class="period">Aug 2021 — Mar 2022</span>
        </div>
        <p class="role-summary">Built AI-powered document processing tools using NLP and Computer Vision.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Delivered AI models integration for document extraction and classification.</li>
          <li>Managed cross-functional teams to enhance information extraction accuracy.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="role">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Product Lead</h3>
            <span class="company"><a href="https://www.haufe.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Haufe</a> · Barcelona</span>
          </div>
          <span class="period">Jun 2018 — May 2021</span>
        </div>
        <p class="role-summary">Built and scaled product organization delivering greenfield SaaS and platform services across HRIS modules.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Launched two greenfield B2B SaaS products, including a talent marketplace and foundational cross-team services.</li>
          <li>Led and scaled 3 product teams with full ownership of strategy, execution, and roadmap.</li>
          <li>Enabled reuse and scalability across the product ecosystem through modular architecture and shared services.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="role">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Group Product Manager</h3>
            <span class="company"><a href="https://www.roca.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Roca</a> · Barcelona</span>
          </div>
          <span class="period">Dec 2016 — Jun 2018</span>
        </div>
        <p class="role-summary">Led APAC regional product teams and product portfolio.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Managed regional product strategy and a team of 5 PMs across APAC.</li>
          <li>Launched new products end-to-end: design, supplier agreements, investment, production, and marketing.</li>
          <li>Implemented product lifecycle and go-to-market strategies across the region.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="resume-section">
      <h2>Education</h2>

      <div class="role">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Master's in Business Administration</h3>
            <span class="company">EAE Business School</span>
          </div>
          <span class="period">2018 — 2020</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="role">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Industrial Engineering</h3>
            <span class="company">UPC Barcelona (ETSEIB)</span>
          </div>
          <span class="period">2005 — 2012</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="role">
        <div class="role-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Mechanical Engineering</h3>
            <span class="company">INSA Toulouse</span>
          </div>
          <span class="period">2005 — 2012</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <section class="resume-section">
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div>
          <h4>Strategy</h4>
          <p>Global product strategy, platform architecture, cross-sell enablement, ARPU growth, modular multi-product systems</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Domains</h4>
          <p>B2B SaaS, marketplace platforms, HRIS, payroll, ERP, document processing, AI/ML products</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Leadership</h4>
          <p>Multi-team direction (up to 8 teams), stakeholder alignment, agile & lean development, roadmap ownership</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Integrations</h4>
          <p>Ecosystem & platform integrations, HRIS interoperability, real-time automation, cross-platform pipelines</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .summary {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .resume-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.125rem;
  }

  h4 {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
  }

  .role {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .role:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .role-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .company {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .company a {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--transition);
  }

  .company a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .period {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    padding-top: 0.1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .role-summary {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.125rem;
  }

  li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(190px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .skills-grid p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .role-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
